---
// L'extrusion: la stessa geometria 2D estesa in verticale diventa palo, muro o blocco.
---

<figure class="my-8">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 660 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="extrusion-title" class="h-auto w-full text-foreground">
    <title id="extrusion-title">
      Estrudendo, un punto diventa un palo, una linea un muro e un poligono un blocco.
    </title>

    <text x="110" y="44" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-foreground">punto → palo</text>
    <text x="330" y="44" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-foreground">linea → muro</text>
    <text x="530" y="44" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-foreground">poligono → blocco</text>

    <!-- punto -->
    <line x1="110" y1="190" x2="110" y2="105" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="6" />
    <circle cx="110" cy="190" r="4.5" class="fill-foreground" />
    <line x1="70" y1="190" x2="150" y2="190" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="1" />

    <!-- linea -->
    <path d="M 260 190 L 400 168 L 400 108 L 260 130 Z" fill="none" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1="260" y1="190" x2="400" y2="168" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="3" />
    <circle cx="260" cy="190" r="3.5" class="fill-foreground" />
    <circle cx="400" cy="168" r="3.5" class="fill-foreground" />

    <!-- poligono -->
    <path d="M 470 200 L 530 188 L 570 202 L 508 216 Z" fill="none" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M 470 145 L 530 133 L 570 147 L 508 161 Z" fill="none" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1="470" y1="200" x2="470" y2="145" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1="530" y1="188" x2="530" y2="133" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1="570" y1="202" x2="570" y2="147" class="stroke-foreground" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1="508" y1="216" x2="508" y2="161" class="stroke-border" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

    <text x="110" y="234" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-muted-foreground">un lampione</text>
    <text x="330" y="234" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-muted-foreground">una recinzione</text>
    <text x="530" y="234" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-muted-foreground">un edificio</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
    L'extrusion è una proprietà di <strong class="font-medium text-foreground">visualizzazione</strong>,
    non una modifica della geometria: la feature resta bidimensionale e l'altezza viene calcolata al
    rendering. Come valore si può usare qualunque attributo numerico, non solo un'altezza reale —
    l'altezza di una sezione di censimento può rappresentarne la popolazione.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
